sanctioned: soundness regression for task #54 — two `Uuid.v4 ()` calls yield DIFFERENT ids because entropy is typed as an effect (() -> Task Error String), not a memoizable pure String. The Go reference types Uuid.v4 as a bare `String` (Limitation #7) and cannot express this Task-sequenced program, so it is not Go-oracled; Ipe records its own correct output "ok-distinct".
